。趙高短稱高限後段敘事，官稱及嵌套指代待核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","surfaces":["項梁"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:p032","quote":"趙高使其客十餘輩詐為御史、謁者、侍中，更往覆訊斯。斯更以其實對，輒使人復榜之。後二世使人驗斯，斯以為如前，終不敢更言，辭服。奏當上，二世喜曰：「微趙君，幾為丞相所賣。」及二世所使案三川之守至，則項梁已擊殺之。使者來，會丞相下吏，趙高皆妄為反辭。"}]}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:p032","text":"趙高使其客十餘輩詐為御史、謁者、侍中，更往覆訊斯。斯更以其實對，輒使人復榜之。後二世使人驗斯，斯以為如前，終不敢更言，辭服。奏當上，二世喜曰：「微趙君，幾為丞相所賣。」及二世所使案三川之守至，則項梁已擊殺之。使者來，會丞相下吏，趙高皆妄為反辭。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m032-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"趙高","kind":"person","person_id":"4ai_d4s_gde","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m032-0003","start":3,"end":8,"surface":"其客十餘輩","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、引古短稱、未定親屬或泛稱保留未解，不補名、世系或神名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m032-0010","start":10,"end":18,"surface":"御史、謁者、侍中","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、引古短稱、未定親屬或泛稱保留未解，不補名、世系或神名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m032-0023","start":23,"end":24,"surface":"斯","kind":"person","person_id":"5ok_joj_etv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m032-0025","start":25,"end":26,"surface":"斯","kind":"person","person_id":"5ok_joj_etv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m032-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"二世","kind":"person","person_id":"z0a_bdl_gn5_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m032-0045","start":45,"end":46,"surface":"斯","kind":"person","person_id":"5ok_joj_etv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m032-0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"斯","kind":"person","person_id":"5ok_joj_etv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m032-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"二世","kind":"person","person_id":"z0a_bdl_gn5_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m032-0073","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"趙君","kind"